    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Revised YC Application"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Company Description**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Old:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-184",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"Nodebook is an agent-native workspace that unifies email, calendar, notes, and tasks...\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**New:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"We're building the trust layer for AI agents. Current AI systems can't prove their answers are correct—they hallucinate numbers, use stale data, and have no audit trails. This prevents AI deployment in high-stakes domains like finance, healthcare, and legal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> We created LD-C (Linked Data - Computable), a specification that makes AI agents verifiable. Every computation has provenance, units are checked, and constraints prevent errors. When an agent calculates something, you can prove it's correct."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-190",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Nodebook is our first product: a personal AI that manages your life (email, calendar, finances) with full auditability. But the real opportunity is licensing LD-C to enterprises deploying AI agents."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> Think: SSL/TLS for AI agents—infrastructure that makes AI safe for production.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-195",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**What's New?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-196",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Old:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-197",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"AI with persistent memory instead of goldfish memory\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-198",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-199",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**New:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-200",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"Verifiable computation for AI agents. When ChatGPT says 'your monthly burn rate is $8,500', you can't verify it. When our agent says it, you see every source document, every calculation step, and every constraint check."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-201",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-202",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> This isn't just better UX—it's the difference between 'plausible' and 'provable'. And for regulated industries, that's the difference between 'demo' and 'production'.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-203",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-204",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Traction**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-205",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Old:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-206",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"10 daily users managing their personal workflow\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-207",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
