    },
    {
      "id": "b-215",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-216",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Market**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-217",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Old:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-218",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"Knowledge workers who want better tools\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-219",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-220",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**New:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-221",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"Every company deploying AI agents. The EU AI Act (2024) requires 'explainable AI' for high-risk systems. Insurance companies are starting to require AI auditability. Financial regulators are scrutinizing AI-driven decisions."
        }
